# Raw Claude Code transcripts.
#
# These were the full chat logs the project was built through — 25 files and
# about 2.7 MB of them sat in the repo root. They are kept out now for two
# reasons, and size is the smaller one:
#
#   * A raw transcript is whatever was said, including pasted keys, paths from
#     someone's own machine, and half-finished ideas. That is not something to
#     hand to everyone who clones the repo.
#   * They are not source. Nothing builds from them and nothing reads them.
#
# The distilled version, .session_notes.md, IS tracked on purpose — it is the
# genuinely useful part: what the app is for, what was decided, and why.
.session_part_*.txt
.session_readable.txt

